atting.\n\nThe script handles three main XSS vectors:\n\n1. **`<script>` tags** — Removes all script tags and their contents (multiline-aware)\n2. **Event handler attributes** — Strips `onclick`, `onload`, `onerror`, `onmouseover`, etc. (any `on*` attribute)\n3. **JavaScript URLs** — Removes `javascript:` protocol from `href`, `src`, `action`, `data`, `poster` attributes\n\nThe regex patterns are designed to preserve the original HTML formatting, spacing, and newlines. All other HTML structure, attributes, and content are kept intact.\n\nUsage:\n```bash\npython filter.py input.html\n```\n\nThe file is modified in-place. Error handling covers missing files and I/O issues.","ttft_ms":7287,"type":"result","duration_ms":12454,"uuid":"8a5a9e42-9893-452f-8154-aa30fea228fb","ttft_stream_ms":817,"time_to_request_ms":40,"queued_turn_count":0}
